{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788632101658,"sessionID":"ses_f8d3af518ffeLlqe3jGkU1uCSu","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_mDGU9rsM7Bb93BoYdBUDMvFj","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-010.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-010.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Iteration 010: Final Adversarial Coverage And Verdict\n2: \n3: ## Focus\n4: Run the required final pass over the packet, all accumulated findings, current generated metadata and lineage artifacts. Convergence remains telemetry only.\n5: \n6: ## Sources Reviewed\n7: - `spec.md:19-32,40-50,64-83,118-143,224-236`\n8: - `plan.md:22-33,40-48,53-84,98-116`\n9: - `tasks.md:34-71,98-183`\n10: - `acceptance-criteria.md:42-91`\n11: - `implementation-summary.md:40-72,136-155,208-245,247-301,306-358`\n12: - `description.json:1-30`\n13: - `graph-metadata.json:42-63,211-230`\n14: - `deep-review-config.json`\n15: - `deep-review-state.jsonl`\n16: - `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n17: - `deep-review-strategy.md`\n18: - `deep-review-dashboard.md`\n19: \n20: ## Findings\n21: No new distinct finding was admitted in the final pass.\n22: \n23: The active finding set remains F001-F018, with duplicated evidence grouped by root cause. The strongest confirmed packet-level blockers are F005, F007, F017 and F018. The lineage also retains evidence-only P1 items for verification commands that were intentionally not executed here: F001, F003, F009, F011, F013 and F015. No P0 finding was established.\n24: \n25: The final adversarial replay confirms that implementation-path claims and packet-state claims must not be merged. Current package manifests and external consumers use `runtime/cli`, but generated causal metadata, subordinate documentation and completion-marked scaffold content still carry contradictory or stale state.\n26: \n27: ## Coverage\n28: - Iterations: 10 of 10\n29: - Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n30: - Core protocols: `spec_code` fail, `checklist_evidence` fail\n31: - Overlay protocols: `feature_catalog_code` partial, `playbook_capability` partial\n32: - Resource-map coverage: skipped because no resource map existed at initialization\n33: - Graph convergence: unavailable under lineage-only write restrictions\n34: \n35: ## Final Determination\n36: The max-iterations policy requires synthesis after this pass. The review verdict is CONDITIONAL because active P1 findings remain and no P0 was confirmed. The release-readiness state is `release-blocking` until the packet truth, generated metadata and completion placeholder issues are reconciled and the omitted command gates are replayed.\n37: \n38: ## Adversarial Checks\n39: - Rechecked the current nested package manifest against root workspace and lockfile references.\n40: - Rechecked generated metadata identity against current package names and paths.\n41: - Rechecked the scaffold placeholder block against completion metadata.\n42: - Rechecked all P1 evidence anchors used by the synthesis report.\n43: - Did not run repository tooling, install, build, tests, validation or git writes.\n44: \n45: ## Recommended Next Focus\n46: Synthesis of the ten iteration files, deltas and evidence registry into the lineage report.\n47: \n48: Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n\n(End of file - total 48 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Iteration 010: Final Adversarial Coverage And Verdict\n\n## Focus\nRun the required final pass over the packet, all accumulated findings, current generated metadata and lineage artifacts. Convergence remains telemetry only.\n\n## Sources Reviewed\n- `spec.md:19-32,40-50,64-83,118-143,224-236`\n- `plan.md:22-33,40-48,53-84,98-116`\n- `tasks.md:34-71,98-183`\n- `acceptance-criteria.md:42-91`\n- `implementation-summary.md:40-72,136-155,208-245,247-301,306-358`\n- `description.json:1-30`\n- `graph-metadata.json:42-63,211-230`\n- `deep-review-config.json`\n- `deep-review-state.jsonl`\n- `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- `deep-review-strategy.md`\n- `deep-review-dashboard.md`\n\n## Findings","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/044-zvec-grep-integration/.opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-010.md","text":"# Iteration 010: Final Adversarial Coverage And Verdict\n\n## Focus\nRun the required final pass over the packet, all accumulated findings, current generated metadata and lineage artifacts. Convergence remains telemetry only.\n\n## Sources Reviewed\n- `spec.md:19-32,40-50,64-83,118-143,224-236`\n- `plan.md:22-33,40-48,53-84,98-116`\n- `tasks.md:34-71,98-183`\n- `acceptance-criteria.md:42-91`\n- `implementation-summary.md:40-72,136-155,208-245,247-301,306-358`\n- `description.json:1-30`\n- `graph-metadata.json:42-63,211-230`\n- `deep-review-config.json`\n- `deep-review-state.jsonl`\n- `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- `deep-review-strategy.md`\n- `deep-review-dashboard.md`\n\n## Findings\nNo new distinct finding was admitted in the final pass.\n\nThe active finding set remains F001-F018, with duplicated evidence grouped by root cause. The strongest confirmed packet-level blockers are F005, F007, F017 and F018. The lineage also retains evidence-only P1 items for verification commands that were intentionally not executed here: F001, F003, F009, F011, F013 and F015. No P0 finding was established.\n\nThe final adversarial replay confirms that implementation-path claims and packet-state claims must not be merged. Current package manifests and external consumers use `runtime/cli`, but generated causal metadata, subordinate documentation and completion-marked scaffold content still carry contradictory or stale state.\n\n## Coverage\n- Iterations: 10 of 10\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability\n- Core protocols: `spec_code` fail, `checklist_evidence` fail\n- Overlay protocols: `feature_catalog_code` partial, `playbook_capability` partial\n- Resource-map coverage: skipped because no resource map existed at initialization\n- Graph convergence: unavailable under lineage-only write restrictions\n\n## Final Determination\nThe max-iterations policy requires synthesis after this pass. The review verdict is CONDITIONAL because active P1 findings remain and no P0 was confirmed. The release-readiness state is `release-blocking` until the packet truth, generated metadata and completion placeholder issues are reconciled and the omitted command gates are replayed.\n\n## Adversarial Checks\n- Rechecked the current nested package manifest against root workspace and lockfile references.\n- Rechecked generated metadata identity against current package names and paths.\n- Rechecked the scaffold placeholder block against completion metadata.\n- Rechecked all P1 evidence anchors used by the synthesis report.\n- Did not run repository tooling, install, build, tests, validation or git writes.\n\n## Recommended Next Focus\nSynthesis of the ten iteration files, deltas and evidence registry into the lineage report.\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":48,"totalLines":48,"truncated":false}},"title":".opencode/specs/system-speckit/054-decommission-debt-fixes/002-scripts-into-runtime-nesting/review/lineages/luna-max-review-5/iterations/iteration-010.md","time":{"start":1788632101630,"end":1788632101658}},"id":"prt_072c7f2fd001p4iXHUZYnzZ0vO","sessionID":"ses_f8d3af518ffeLlqe3jGkU1uCSu","messageID":"msg_072c7b8c1001eH1hd0scqzAgF7"}}
